// reauth-wake
//
// Live tailscaled devices restarting under their own node key, then running tailscale up --auth-key as containerboot does, with a key they did not join with: spent, expired, revoked, unused, other tags, a user's. A -new cell joins with the key afterwards, so the key's state shows whether the restart spent it. Forced logins with such keys close.
